          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Buy a 4000 watt class generator when you need to start an air conditioner: the rooftop unit on a 30-amp RV, or a window unit plus the refrigerator at home. For most buyers that is the Champion 201319, with 4,500 starting watts, dual fuel, electric start and CO Shield. The WEN DF450i does most of the same for less, and the Westinghouse iGen4000DFc is the quietest if you fit a soft starter.
          </p>
